# Physics: T_UQFF = T_H � (1 + f_TRZ) � (1 - ?_vac_SCm / ?_vac_UA)

# Where T_H = ?c� / (8pGMk_B) is standard Hawking temperature

# f_TRZ: Time Reversal Zone retrocausality factor

