        # Tidal locking timescale — R382 REVISION 4 (2026-07-24, deepsearch found
        # PAPER_1953 + PAPER_1954: k2/Q is now FULLY primitive-locked, not a citation).
        # THREE-PAPER PRIMITIVE CHAIN (all EXACT, zero free parameters):
